WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Luke blocks Ryu’s recorded Drive Reversal in the corner.

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:01.850
Crouching medium punch catches Ryu’s recovery as Punish Counter.

3
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.550
Standing light punch links into Triple Impact.

4
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.050
The heavy target hit launches Ryu at the wall.

5
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:03.600
Medium Sand Blast continues the corner juggle.

6
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.750
Light Rising Uppercut finishes the punish.

7
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.050
Luke lands beside the corner knockdown.
